Package: traittree
Title: Scale Phylogenies by Phenotypic Change
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Brian", "Maitner", email = "bmaitner@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Rescales the branches of a phylogeny from units of time to units
    of phenotypic change, using ancestral trait reconstruction. Uncertainty in
    the reconstruction can be carried through to downstream analyses by drawing
    trees from the joint posterior of the ancestral states. Also blends
    phylogenetic and trait distances following Cadotte, Albert and Walker
    (2013) <doi:10.1111/ele.12161>, and maps phylogenetic diversity and its
    standardized index, with exact null moments from Nipperess and Matsen
    (2013) <doi:10.1111/2041-210X.12042> and the rarefaction of Sandel (2018)
    <doi:10.1111/ecog.02967>.
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
